<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle trading slow - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle trading slow - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers not fully established. Trade fairly slow. Demand light to moderate.</p>
<p>Seller interest light. Offerings current.</p>
<p>Steers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1150-1200 lbs 1.5 lds 63.50-64.00.</p>
<p>Heifers:Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1050-1125 lbs few 63.50-64.00</p>
<p>		    Carcass Basis (weight only)</p>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers mostly steady.</p>
<p>Steers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1150-1275 lbs 102.00-103.00</p>
<p>Confirmed Sales: 1,500  Week Ago:18,400 Year Ago: 12,900</p>
<p> Week to Date:    4,800  Week Ago:23,200 Year Ago: 18,000</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
